~~~/README.md
# Halfdays High-Fashion E-commerce Component

A production-grade, editorial-style e-commerce interface for the Halfdays brand. Implements a minimalist, high-impact aesthetic inspired by luxury outdoor apparel retail.

## Main Functionality
- **Premium Navigation**: Fixed header with backdrop-blur and minimal menu system.
- **Cinematic Hero**: Large visual impact using layered typography and full-bleed imagery.
- **Editorial Category Grid**: Asymmetric layout for high-interest product discovery.
- **Modern Footer**: Structured information architecture with minimalist design tokens.
- **Custom Typography**: Integration of Cabinet Grotesk (Sans) and Gambetta (Serif).

## Dependencies
- `react`: ^18.3.1
- `lucide-react`: ^0.454.0
- `framer-motion`: ^11.11.11 (optional for animations)

## Props
| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| - | - | This is a full-page layout component with no external props at the top level. |

## Usage
```tsx
import { Component as HalfdaysStore } from '@/sd-components/9930c91d-166c-4b62-8436-c825f64a9324';

export default function StorePage() {
  return (
    <div className="bg-white">
      <HalfdaysStore />
    </div>
  );
}
```

